      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "A dev copy and the prod copy are almost the same: the same Deployment, Services, probes and database."
        },
        {
          "text": "A few things have to differ. Its own namespace, so the two never touch, and its own hostname."
        },
        {
          "text": "Dev runs the next version of the image, fewer pods, a smaller database, and more detailed logs."
        },
        {
          "text": "Copying the whole folder works for a week. Then someone fixes a probe in one copy and not the other, and the two quietly drift apart.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.4
        }
      ]
    },
