          "text": "The dev overlay starts the same way, with its own namespace, golinks-dev, and its own label.",
          "say": "The dev overlay starts the same way, with its own namespace, go links dash dev, and its own label."
        },
        {
          "text": "It runs the next image, 0.2.0.",
          "say": "It runs the next image, zero point two point zero."
        },
        {
          "text": "Then a list of patches. Each names a target, by kind and name, and a small file that says what to change in it."
        },
