        {
          "text": "So now there are two kinds of change. Fix a probe in the base, and both environments get it."
        },
        {
          "text": "Change an overlay, and only that environment does."
        },
        {
          "text": "A release becomes a short walk. Set the new tag in dev, and try it on go-dev."
        },
        {
          "text": "When it's good, set the same tag in prod. A one line change that anyone can review."
        },
        {
          "text": "The last step is still someone running kubectl apply, by hand, from their laptop. Hold that thought.",
          "say": "The last step is still someone running cube control apply, by hand, from their laptop. Hold that thought."
        },
        {
          "text": "One rule of thumb: keep overlays small. If one keeps growing, something in it probably belongs in the base.",
